{"stories":{"ep5/npcpanel_menu_10014280":{"episode":"ep5","category":"npcpanel_menu","story_id":"10014280","sequence_index":30,"plot_row_index":"6084","order_index":"6084","numeric_id":"10014280","physical_section":"ep5","plot_id":"10014280","dialogue_kind":"Menu","metadata_source":"story_metadata_generated_context","metadata_sources":["story_metadata_context"],"summary":"","context_summary_source_cn":"从隆尔口中，你们得知呼临城内大半的议事官都主战，只有珀尔修斯犹豫不决。幸好，战争尚有转圜的余地。","context_summary_i18n":{"cn":"从隆尔口中，你们得知呼临城内大半的议事官都主战，只有珀尔修斯犹豫不决。幸好，战争尚有转圜的余地。","en":"From Lygos you learn the truth: most of Halia's councilmen want war. Only Perseus still hesitates. And as long as he does, there is still a chance to turn things around.","jp":"ロンゴスの口から、ホーリンの議事官の大半が開戦を支持していることを知らされた。しかしただ一人、ペルセウスだけが決断を迷っていた。幸いにも、まだ平和的解決の余地は残されているのだ。","kr":"로르의 입을 통해, 보칼리스 의원의 절반이 전쟁을 주장하고 있고 페르세우스만 망설이고 있다는 사실을 알게 되었다. 다행히 아직 상황을 되돌릴 여지는 있어 보인다."},"context_summary_status":{"cn":"aligned_plot_summary","en":"aligned_plot_summary","jp":"aligned_plot_summary","kr":"aligned_plot_summary"},"context_summary_record_index":25391,"context_summary_record_indices":[25391],"context_summary_match_status":"aligned_exact_unique","context_summary_source_asset_key":"ep5/npcpanel_menu_10006820","context_summary_direction":"next_plot_summary","context_summary_distance":20,"episode_title_source_cn":"血月将至","episode_title_i18n":{"cn":"血月将至","en":"Thorns of Devotion","jp":"紅き月の刻","kr":"붉은 달의 예언"},"episode_title_status":{"cn":"exact_unique","en":"exact_unique","jp":"exact_unique","kr":"exact_unique"},"episode_title_evidence":{"source":"Config/Season.luae","table_key":"105","season_type":"105","entry_condition":"ed.ConditionX.IsUserInEp(\"Ep05\")","opening_quest":"15010101","episode":"ep5","status":"explicit_episode_and_opening_quest"},"asset_key":"ep5/npcpanel_menu_10014280","asset_path":"ep5/npcpanel_menu/NodeCanvas__DialogueTree__ep5__npcpanel_menu_10014280.decoded.json","graph":"stories/ep5/npcpanel_menu/10014280.graph.json","locales":{"cn