死而复生的魔法，他对死神似乎很不满。","en":"The burials are finished. At the ritual, Morgan summons the souls of the dead, allowing the living to say a proper goodbye. Now, he turns his focus back to studying magic that can revive the dead. He seems to deeply resent the God of Death.","jp":"ホーリンとヤクボルの葬儀はすべて順調に終わった。儀式では、モルガンが死者の魂を呼び出し、残された家族と別れをすることができた。死神に不満を持つモルガンは、このまま死者を蘇らせる魔法を研究するつもりらしい。","kr":"보칼리스와 아쿠보르의 장례가 순조롭게 진행되었다. 제사 의식에서 모르간은 죽은 자들의 영혼을 불러내 산 자들과 작별 인사를 할 수 있게 도왔다. 모르간은 죽음의 신에게 강한 불만을 감추지 않고 계속해서 죽은 자를 살리는 마법을 연구할 것이라고 했다."},"context_summary_status":{"cn":"aligned_plot_summary","en":"aligned_plot_summary","jp":"aligned_plot_summary","kr":"aligned_plot_summary"},"context_summary_record_index":25581,"context_summary_record_indices":[25581],"context_summary_match_status":"aligned_exact_unique","context_summary_source_asset_key":"ep5/npcpanel_menu_10031230","context_summary_direction":"next_plot_summary","context_summary_distance":4,"episode_title_source_cn":"血月将至","episode_title_i18n":{"cn":"血月将至","en":"Thorns of Devotion","jp":"紅き月の刻","kr":"붉은 달의 예언"},"episode_title_status":{"cn":"exact_unique","en":"exact_unique","jp":"exact_unique","kr":"exact_unique"},"episode_title_evidence":{"source":"Config/Season.luae","table_key":"105","season_type":"105","entry_condition":"ed.ConditionX.IsUserInEp(\"Ep05\")","opening_quest":"15010101","episode":"ep5","status":"explicit_episode_and_opening_quest"},"asset_key":"ep5/npcpanel_menu_10014130","asset_path":"ep5/npcpanel_menu/NodeCanvas__DialogueTree__ep5__npcpanel_menu_10014130.decoded.json","graph":"stories/ep5/npcpanel_menu/10014130.graph.json","locales":{"cn":"locales/cn/ep5/npcpanel_menu/10014130.json","en":"locales/en/ep5/npcpanel_menu/10014130.json","jp":"locales/jp/ep5/npcpanel_menu/10014130.json","kr":"locales/kr/ep5/npcpanel_menu/10014130.json"},"machine_locales":{},"stats":{"source_node_count":7,"graph_node_count":3,"effect_event_count":0,"text_entry_count":0,"speaker_entry_count":0,"cast_state_line_count":0,"path_dependent_cas